{"cast":"boardwalk","group":"three","bank":"three.3a5d70ef4a.bin","lines":[{"id":"three.intro.01","moment":"three.intro","text":"Welcome to Downtown on the beach! Five racks, sixty seconds, money balls on every rack. Six shooters, top three move on!","off":0,"len":33123,"sec":7.005},{"id":"three.intro.02","moment":"three.intro","text":"Downtown at Venice Beach! Sixty seconds, five racks, gold money balls worth two. Six shooters, only three advance!","off":33123,"len":32721,"sec":6.853},{"id":"three.intro.03","moment":"three.intro","text":"Shooters on the sand! It's Downtown: five racks, sixty seconds, six shooters, top three advance. Grab that money ball!","off":65844,"len":32505,"sec":6.666},{"id":"three.go.01","moment":"three.go","text":"Paddle out, shooter!","off":98349,"len":8877,"sec":1.041},{"id":"three.go.02","moment":"three.go","text":"Sixty seconds, go!","off":107226,"len":10213,"sec":1.242},{"id":"three.go.03","moment":"three.go","text":"Start splashing!","off":117439,"len":9037,"sec":0.991},{"id":"three.rack.01","moment":"three.rack","text":"Next rack, keep rolling!","off":126476,"len":9952,"sec":1.241},{"id":"three.rack.02","moment":"three.rack","text":"New rack, same sand!","off":136428,"len":9644,"sec":1.176},{"id":"three.rack.03","moment":"three.rack","text":"Slide on over!","off":146072,"len":8309,"sec":0.939},{"id":"three.rack.04","moment":"three.rack","text":"Roll to the next rack!","off":154381,"len":10005,"sec":1.171},{"id":"three.lastrack.01","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Last rack! Empty the tank!","off":164386,"len":11217,"sec":1.347},{"id":"three.lastrack.02","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"Final rack, Venice, get loud!","off":175603,"len":11386,"sec":1.527},{"id":"three.lastrack.03","moment":"three.lastrack","text":"One rack left, sunset's coming!","off":186989,"len":12098,"sec":1.762},{"id":"three.money.01","moment":"three.money","text":"Money ball! Cash it!","off":199087,"len":9238,"sec":1.076},{"id":"three.money.02","moment":"three.money","text":"Gold ball, double points!","off":208325,"len":10673,"sec":1.475},{"id":"three.money.03","moment":"three.money","text":"Here's the money!","off":218998,"len":8461,"sec":0.842},{"id":"three.money.04","moment":"three.money","text":"Payday on the beach!","off":227459,"len":9009,"sec":1.051},{"id":"three.make.01","moment":"three.make","text":"Splash!","off":236468,"len":7199,"sec":0.661},{"id":"three.make.02","moment":"three.make","text":"Count it!","off":243667,"len":7069,"sec":0.683},{"id":"three.make.03","moment":"three.make","text":"Wet sand!","off":250736,"len":8190,"sec":0.761},{"id":"three.make.04","moment":"three.make","text":"Boardwalk bucket!","off":258926,"len":8783,"sec":1.033},{"id":"three.make.05","moment":"three.make","text":"Pure!","off":267709,"len":6253,"sec":0.492},{"id":"three.make.06","moment":"three.make","text":"Swish, Venice!","off":273962,"len":8635,"sec":0.89},{"id":"three.make.money.01","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Money in the bank!","off":282597,"len":8965,"sec":0.918},{"id":"three.make.money.02","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Cash register's ringing!","off":291562,"len":10223,"sec":1.238},{"id":"three.make.money.03","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Gold ball, gone!","off":301785,"len":8742,"sec":1.053},{"id":"three.make.money.04","moment":"three.make.money","text":"Two-for-one special!","off":310527,"len":9567,"sec":1.131},{"id":"three.miss.01","moment":"three.miss","text":"Short!","off":320094,"len":6737,"sec":0.57},{"id":"three.miss.02","moment":"three.miss","text":"Choppy water!","off":326831,"len":8169,"sec":0.876},{"id":"three.miss.03","moment":"three.miss","text":"Missed the wave!","off":335000,"len":8432,"sec":0.837},{"id":"three.miss.04","moment":"three.miss","text":"Wipeout!","off":343432,"len":7901,"sec":0.668},{"id":"three.miss.05","moment":"three.miss","text":"Next ball!","off":351333,"len":7792,"sec":0.784},{"id":"three.streak.01","moment":"three.streak","text":"Surf's building, Venice!","off":359125,"len":10132,"sec":1.249},{"id":"three.streak.02","moment":"three.streak","text":"Wave after wave!","off":369257,"len":9353,"sec":1.021},{"id":"three.streak.03","moment":"three.streak","text":"Piling them up!","off":378610,"len":7833,"sec":0.847},{"id":"three.streak.04","moment":"three.streak","text":"Rhythm on the boardwalk!","off":386443,"len":9825,"sec":1.237},{"id":"three.fire.01","moment":"three.fire","text":"Automatic! Venice, stand up!","off":396268,"len":10990,"sec":1.42},{"id":"three.fire.02","moment":"three.fire","text":"Every shot's a splash! Unreal!","off":407258,"len":12396,"sec":1.798},{"id":"three.fire.03","moment":"three.fire","text":"Hotter than noon on the sand!","off":419654,"len":10623,"sec":1.386},{"id":"three.fire.04","moment":"three.fire","text":"Pier's shaking! Nothing's missing!","off":430277,"len":11348,"sec":1.53},{"id":"three.cold.01","moment":"three.cold","text":"Rim's closed for lunch, apparently!","off":441625,"len":12075,"sec":1.799},{"id":"three.cold.02","moment":"three.cold","text":"Cold water! Shake it off!","off":453700,"len":10284,"sec":1.297},{"id":"three.cold.03","moment":"three.cold","text":"Find the wave again, shooter!","off":463984,"len":10297,"sec":1.325},{"id":"three.clock.01","moment":"three.clock","text":"Ten seconds! Quick hands!","off":474281,"len":10946,"sec":1.394},{"id":"three.clock.02","moment":"three.clock","text":"Clock says ten! Hurry!","off":485227,"len":10032,"sec":1.243},{"id":"three.clock.03","moment":"three.clock","text":"Final ten, empty the rack!","off":495259,"len":11126,"sec":1.472},{"id":"three.buzzer.01","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Beat the horn! It counts!","off":506385,"len":9661,"sec":1.241},{"id":"three.buzzer.02","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Out in time! Splash counts!","off":516046,"len":11244,"sec":1.506},{"id":"three.buzzer.03","moment":"three.buzzer","text":"Just under the wire! Count it!","off":527290,"len":10920,"sec":1.416},{"id":"three.results.01","moment":"three.results","text":"Numbers rolling in, one shooter at a time...","off":538210,"len":14367,"sec":2.225},{"id":"three.results.02","moment":"three.results","text":"Let's check the board. Venice, hold your breath!","off":552577,"len":14027,"sec":2.158},{"id":"three.advance.01","moment":"three.advance","text":"You're through to the final! Grab some water, shooter, you earned it!","off":566604,"len":16317,"sec":2.897},{"id":"three.advance.02","moment":"three.advance","text":"Made the cut! The final's waiting, and Venice wants more!","off":582921,"len":16959,"sec":2.865},{"id":"three.advance.03","moment":"three.advance","text":"Advancing! Save some splash for the final!","off":599880,"len":13731,"sec":2.124},{"id":"three.out.01","moment":"three.out","text":"Out in qualifying. The waves just weren't breaking today. Come back soon!","off":613611,"len":20652,"sec":3.784},{"id":"three.out.02","moment":"three.out","text":"So close, shooter! Grab a lemonade, and run it back!","off":634263,"len":15678,"sec":2.632},{"id":"three.out.03","moment":"three.out","text":"Missed the cut, but Venice saw the touch. Next time, it falls!","off":649941,"len":17398,"sec":3.088},{"id":"three.final.01","moment":"three.final","text":"Final round! You shoot last. Drum circle, give this shooter a beat!","off":667339,"len":18571,"sec":3.477},{"id":"three.final.02","moment":"three.final","text":"Everybody else has posted. Last shooter on the sand, this one's yours to take!","off":685910,"len":22554,"sec":4.304},{"id":"three.final.03","moment":"three.final","text":"The number's up on the board, kid. Top it, and the whole pier knows!","off":708464,"len":18404,"sec":3.239},{"id":"three.clinch.01","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Number's cooked! Beach party!","off":726868,"len":11865,"sec":1.58},{"id":"three.clinch.02","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Passed it! Downtown is yours!","off":738733,"len":11307,"sec":1.549},{"id":"three.clinch.03","moment":"three.clinch","text":"Clinched! Pop the lemonade!","off":750040,"len":10634,"sec":1.395},{"id":"three.champion.01","moment":"three.champion","text":"Three-point champion of Venice Beach! Splash after splash, and the ocean's jealous!","off":760674,"len":23190,"sec":4.534},{"id":"three.champion.02","moment":"three.champion","text":"Downtown belongs to the kid! Boardwalk approved, trophy approved, taco on me!","off":783864,"len":22645,"sec":4.375},{"id":"three.champion.03","moment":"three.champion","text":"Crown the shooter, Venice! Best touch on the beach, no argument!","off":806509,"len":18395,"sec":3.155}]}